    "atom::bc58b5231303597a3760c61c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bc58b5231303597a3760c61c",
      "source_handle": "P0566",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "解决肺癌免疫治疗临床结局高度异质性的问题，特别是原发性/获得性耐药和免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）。旨在明确微生物组（尤其是肠道和口腔）能否作为非侵入性预测生物标志物，以优化 ICI 疗效并管理毒性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c752d626bf83f163f53f85fd981a4a64b7fc2b1191",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b865884c0403c8e8683e077b8416337897bd9ae3fd45f92f4e5194a00a3bd908",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::02909b647840efc2dba418aa": {
      "atom_id": "atom::02909b647840efc2dba418aa",
      "source_handle": "P0566",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "肺癌（主要为非小细胞肺癌 NSCLC，小细胞肺癌 SCLC 数据缺失）患者接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗时的肠道和口腔/呼吸道微生物组。研究范围涵盖微生物组成、多样性、功能代谢物、临床混杂因素（抗生素、PPI）以及作为预测生物标志物的潜力。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c752d626bf83f163f53f85fd981a4a64b7fc2b1191",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b57b49cd3688c6c642a9f8d3b3bc9f458ed665dfe750558ed65bb8d1de0c5446",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::cb10a6832f9807d6009cd8c5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cb10a6832f9807d6009cd8c5",
      "source_handle": "P0566",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "这是一篇叙事性综述，旨在综合评估微生物组作为肺癌免疫治疗疗效和毒性预测生物标志物的证据。文章系统梳理了肠道和口腔微生物组在 ICI 治疗中的角色，重点分析了特定菌属（如 Akkermansia muciniphila）、微生物多样性及代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸、肌苷）与无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）的关联。同时，综述讨论了抗生素和质子泵抑制剂（PPI）对微生物组的破坏作用及其对预后的负面影响，并探讨了从单一物种标记向复合评分模型转变的趋势，以及粪菌移植（FMT）等干预策略的早期临床数据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c752d626bf83f163f53f85fd981a4a64b7fc2b1191",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8d3df0f1df7607815f33c3d3ad5bd4739ca29efd825745dc5e08efdb5bf3f740",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::535b63d34d78fad676bccd7e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::535b63d34d78fad676bccd7e",
      "source_handle": "P0566",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为综述规划提供了关键的比较维度：区分肠道与口腔微生物组的预测效力差异，以及分类学标记与功能性代谢标记的价值差异。它提供了具体的菌属、代谢物和临床混杂因素（抗生素/PPI）作为素材，用于回答 F1（效应）和 F2（机制），并强调了当前证据在标准化和前瞻性验证方面的缺口，有助于界定综述中“已证实”与“待验证”内容的边界。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c752d626bf83f163f53f85fd981a4a64b7fc2b1191",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::04a0bc12ed0bc8a43f725b3ec85950d396f649f198f574e5e9dca724d952d6e2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::bb97eec65a48d4b515580494": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bb97eec65a48d4b515580494",
      "source_handle": "P0566",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "证据多为观察性关联，因果推断受限；口腔微生物组的阳性结果仅限于特定治疗组合（放化疗+免疫），不可外推至所有 ICI 场景；SCLC 数据缺失。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物组特征（高 alpha 多样性、特定有益菌）与 ICI 疗效（PFS/OS 改善）的正向关联证据，以及抗生素/PPI 暴露与疗效下降的负向关联证据。同时指出口腔微生物组在 ICI 单药治疗中预测价值有限，但在联合治疗中可能有信号。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c752d626bf83f163f53f85fd981a4a64b7fc2b1191",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0a8d93cf52e33e237b1eb087d28dc078213dff5c9d501ac6adddd5f5390bc22c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::406458753c4ae81d3c6b78a5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::406458753c4ae81d3c6b78a5",
      "source_handle": "P0566",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于支持 F1 中关于肠道微生物组调节 ICI 疗效的正面证据，并提供反面案例（口腔微生物组）以展示效应的组织特异性。可用于讨论临床混杂因素对疗效评估的干扰。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c752d626bf83f163f53f85fd981a4a64b7fc2b1191",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8ceed3541d78d3e9a52fd463489cb16a7eda5525936e0c09d7d3dec832da0ae4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::57ee940b9154bb8ebec71f77": {
      "atom_id": "atom::57ee940b9154bb8ebec71f77",
      "source_handle": "P0566",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "许多机制细节源自黑色素瘤或胰腺癌的临床前模型，在 NSCLC 中的直接临床验证不足；部分代谢物（如 SCFAs）的作用具有双重性或情境依赖性（如 butyrate 在黑色素瘤中可能有害，在肺癌中未直接评估）。",
        "contribution": "详细阐述了介导机制：微生物代谢物（SCFAs, inosine, Uro A）通过调节树突状细胞成熟、CD8+ T 细胞priming、TME 重塑及 gut-lung axis 通讯来增强抗肿瘤免疫。同时也提到了潜在的负面机制（如某些 SCFAs 增加 Tregs，LPS 促进 IL-6）。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c752d626bf83f163f53f85fd981a4a64b7fc2b1191",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0a8d93cf52e33e237b1eb087d28dc078213dff5c9d501ac6adddd5f5390bc22c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::194e2041a77797ec0793266f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::194e2041a77797ec0793266f",
      "source_handle": "P0566",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "直接支撑 F2 关于机制的回答，提供具体的分子通路（如 AhR 受体、JAK/STAT）和细胞类型相互作用。可用于解释为何功能性标记比分类学标记更具预测力。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c752d626bf83f163f53f85fd981a4a64b7fc2b1191",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8ceed3541d78d3e9a52fd463489cb16a7eda5525936e0c09d7d3dec832da0ae4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::faa138d638b4ef961b6eb3c4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::faa138d638b4ef961b6eb3c4",
      "source_handle": "P0566",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "综述指出当前研究存在严重的异质性（测序平台、采样时间、生信流程），且多数研究未调整抗生素/PPI 等关键混杂因素。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c752d626bf83f163f53f85fd981a4a64b7fc2b1191",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f2bff1b43221feda9cc2720edf2258e42438976fb0bb8d57e8b8bec7f2ae9323",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::171c38d27351c0dccd6e1546": {
      "atom_id": "atom::171c38d27351c0dccd6e1546",
      "source_handle": "P0566",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses",
        "connection_to_review"
      ],
      "value": "提醒综述作者在综合其他论文时，需关注研究设计的严谨性，并在讨论部分强调标准化和未来前瞻性研究的重要性，避免将低质量证据视为共识。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
