    "atom::cd73c0f181b0330ab3328ee1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cd73c0f181b0330ab3328ee1",
      "source_handle": "P0433",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用系统性文献回顾与综合叙述的方法。作者按逻辑顺序组织材料：从肠道黏膜屏障（先天免疫）入手，逐步分析对髓系细胞（巨噬细胞、树突状细胞）和淋巴系细胞（ILCs、T细胞）的影响；接着聚焦于特定微生物代谢物（SCFAs、肌苷、TMAO、色氨酸、胆汁酸）介导的抗肿瘤免疫反应；最后综述结合ICIs的微生物群治疗策略（FMT、益生菌、益生元、饮食）及其在预防irAEs中的应用。文中引用了大量临床观察性研究、队列研究和动物模型实验证据进行综合论述。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd13b06802dc54694a51a2fd3623f8a23feb295357",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a9079f5135835245f694925e19e138f5fae419eb7975cba172c2c2888a5906f8",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::639d3b1baaee912770ba34f1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::639d3b1baaee912770ba34f1",
      "source_handle": "P0433",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物群调节癌症免疫治疗的多层次机制框架，涵盖了从黏膜屏障到全身免疫细胞（髓系和淋巴系）的广泛互作网络。",
        "limits": "作为综述，其结论依赖于引用的原始研究，部分机制主要基于动物模型或小型观察性研究，缺乏大规模随机对照试验的直接因果证据。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd13b06802dc54694a51a2fd3623f8a23feb295357",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fcd9e4438ad44fc8e6c447b089939bb9c27af7840779f009faf792fb6706aee0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6ca66daecb12bd49acdd5815": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6ca66daecb12bd49acdd5815",
      "source_handle": "P0433",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "系统梳理了五种主要微生物代谢物（SCFAs, Inosine, TMAO, Tryptophan derivatives, Bile acids）在免疫调节中的具体作用路径。",
        "limits": "不同研究中代谢物的测量方法、样本类型（粪便vs血浆）及癌症类型各异，导致直接比较存在困难；部分关联仅为相关性，尚未完全确立因果关系。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd13b06802dc54694a51a2fd3623f8a23feb295357",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fcd9e4438ad44fc8e6c447b089939bb9c27af7840779f009faf792fb6706aee0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::947c49ed771b71df32520851": {
      "atom_id": "atom::947c49ed771b71df32520851",
      "source_handle": "P0433",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "评估了FMT、益生菌、益生元和饮食干预等临床转化策略的现状，指出了标准化和定植效率等关键挑战。",
        "limits": "目前大多数临床试验处于早期阶段（Phase I/II），样本量小，且FMT供体选择、给药方案和长期安全性尚未标准化，难以形成统一的临床指南。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd13b06802dc54694a51a2fd3623f8a23feb295357",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fcd9e4438ad44fc8e6c447b089939bb9c27af7840779f009faf792fb6706aee0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::86aadbb229018afa8c76e39c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::86aadbb229018afa8c76e39c",
      "source_handle": "P0433",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "指出了当前研究的空白，如微生物特征是否具有泛癌种普适性、SCFAs的双向作用矛盾、治疗期间微生物动态变化的预测价值等。",
        "limits": "这些未解问题本身即为局限性的体现，表明该领域仍处于探索阶段，许多假设仍需未来多组学研究和大型前瞻性队列验证。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd13b06802dc54694a51a2fd3623f8a23feb295357",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fcd9e4438ad44fc8e6c447b089939bb9c27af7840779f009faf792fb6706aee0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::184db8501301ec4d0502dee4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::184db8501301ec4d0502dee4",
      "source_handle": "P0433",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "转移性黑色素瘤患者接受伊匹木单抗治疗",
        "finding": "基线肠道微生物群富含Faecalibacterium和其他厚壁菌门的患者比富含拟杆菌的患者具有更长的无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd13b06802dc54694a51a2fd3623f8a23feb295357",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::cc01faa6299b5c7b11a790edcbdc51f5c6dc1580b22a3b9d86833e42953018dd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::879a32130d48905cf03cb52c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::879a32130d48905cf03cb52c",
      "source_handle": "P0433",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "胰腺导管腺癌（PDAC）小鼠模型及临床观察",
        "finding": "乳酸杆菌产生的TMAO促进巨噬细胞向M1型极化，增强效应T细胞反应并提高ICI疗效；而高表达AhR的巨噬细胞与PDAC患者较差的免疫治疗反应相关。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd13b06802dc54694a51a2fd3623f8a23feb295357",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::cc01faa6299b5c7b11a790edcbdc51f5c6dc1580b22a3b9d86833e42953018dd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6915227a4c4ed95c31ceef17": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6915227a4c4ed95c31ceef17",
      "source_handle": "P0433",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "晚期胃肠道癌症患者接受抗PD-1/PD-L1治疗",
        "finding": "粪便中较高浓度的乙酸、丙酸、丁酸和戊酸（SCFAs）以及与PD-1抑制剂疗效显著延长PFS相关。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd13b06802dc54694a51a2fd3623f8a23feb295357",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::cc01faa6299b5c7b11a790edcbdc51f5c6dc1580b22a3b9d86833e42953018dd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f1356dfb86975218fe960216": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f1356dfb86975218fe960216",
      "source_handle": "P0433",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "三阴性乳腺癌临床观察队列（n=360）",
        "finding": "由梭菌目细菌产生的TMAO通过触发癌细胞焦亡增强CD8+ T细胞驱动的抗肿瘤免疫反应，从而提高免疫治疗疗效。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd13b06802dc54694a51a2fd3623f8a23feb295357",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::cc01faa6299b5c7b11a790edcbdc51f5c6dc1580b22a3b9d86833e42953018dd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::30b095e52ad9dd495a39b64d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::30b095e52ad9dd495a39b64d",
      "source_handle": "P0433",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "接受PD-1阻断治疗的结直肠癌患者",
        "finding": "具核梭杆菌（Fusobacterium nucleatum）抑制抗肿瘤T细胞介导的适应性免疫；而Akkermansia muciniphila的补充可重新建立PD-1阻断的疗效。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd13b06802dc54694a51a2fd3623f8a23feb295357",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "4"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::cc01faa6299b5c7b11a790edcbdc51f5c6dc1580b22a3b9d86833e42953018dd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::afc8e779e61ff2cdf0207616": {
      "atom_id": "atom::afc8e779e61ff2cdf0207616",
      "source_handle": "P0433",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "接受PD-1抑制剂治疗的胃癌患者队列",
        "finding": "既往抗生素暴露（pATB）与显著降低的PFS和OS相关，客观缓解率（ORR）和疾病控制率（DCR）在非pATB组显著更高。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd13b06802dc54694a51a2fd3623f8a23feb295357",
          "field_path": [
