    "atom::c3e678fb3ea2081e63b354fd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c3e678fb3ea2081e63b354fd",
      "source_handle": "P0433",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该综述涵盖多种实体瘤，但不同癌症类型中微生物群的作用可能截然不同（如Akkermansia在NSCLC/RCC中有益，但在其他癌症中不一致），使用时需注意癌症类型的特异性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd13b06802dc54694a51a2fd3623f8a23feb295357",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4cbfef8e04a17f488590323621bae82999cc790d9561a2f6f970600f1b76bfa4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d2360beb5d7ef22710f37801": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d2360beb5d7ef22710f37801",
      "source_handle": "P0433",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中提到的许多机制证据来自小鼠模型，直接外推到人类需谨慎，尤其是涉及复杂的人体免疫系统和微生物群落结构时。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd13b06802dc54694a51a2fd3623f8a23feb295357",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4cbfef8e04a17f488590323621bae82999cc790d9561a2f6f970600f1b76bfa4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::50359ff5e38cdcbacfb28b5a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::50359ff5e38cdcbacfb28b5a",
      "source_handle": "P0433",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "临床观察性研究中的关联不等于因果，特别是对于代谢物水平与疗效的关系，可能存在反向因果或混杂因素（如饮食、药物）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd13b06802dc54694a51a2fd3623f8a23feb295357",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4cbfef8e04a17f488590323621bae82999cc790d9561a2f6f970600f1b76bfa4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::4615d5edd36a172156421c14": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4615d5edd36a172156421c14",
      "source_handle": "P0433",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "FMT和益生菌的效果在不同研究中差异巨大，部分源于产品标准化不足和患者基线状态差异，不能一概而论地认为所有微生物干预都有效。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd13b06802dc54694a51a2fd3623f8a23feb295357",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4cbfef8e04a17f488590323621bae82999cc790d9561a2f6f970600f1b76bfa4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
