      "source_handle": "P0561",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "文章强调了肿瘤新抗原是ICI起效的必要条件，并指出当前标志物（TMB, PD-L1）的局限性。同时介绍了微生物组在ICI疗效中的已知作用（抗生素负面、FMT正面）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500ebf160bde94da9c1bac8b5be527d38c7351049f1",
