    "atom::24203a85bfdc072771ead098": {
      "atom_id": "atom::24203a85bfdc072771ead098",
      "source_handle": "P0012",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用单中心回顾性队列设计。纳入标准：确诊晚期黑色素瘤或NSCLC，接受指定TKI（达非替尼、维莫非尼、吉非替尼、阿法替尼、厄洛替尼）一线治疗。暴露定义：在TKI开始前2周至开始后6周内使用任何抗生素（ABX+组）vs. 该期间未使用抗生素（ABX-组）。主要终点：PFS和OS，依据RECIST v1.1标准评估。统计分析：首先进行单变量Cox比例风险模型分析筛选显著因素，随后构建多变量Cox模型以调整年龄、ECOG体能状态（PS）、LDH水平、脑转移等协变量，评估ABX使用的独立预后价值。探索性分析包括ABX累积使用次数及ABX与PS的交互作用。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb59675917ad6fe0c85254d3393fc36f8992b36ec4993b742",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::298d84d4535acaad3b53a3b09923b4d58b34d38a7d30df112b3c95418633fbad",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::e06f4e0000a449162427f3a7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e06f4e0000a449162427f3a7",
      "source_handle": "P0012",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了早期证据，表明在常规临床实践中，抗生素使用是接受TKI治疗的晚期黑色素瘤和NSCLC患者不良预后的独立预测因子。",
        "limits": "研究为回顾性观察性设计，无法确立因果关系；样本量较小（仅55例ABX使用者），限制了按抗生素类别细分分析的效力；未能控制感染本身对预后的潜在影响；所涵盖的TKI药物组合（如单药达非替尼/维莫非尼）已非当前晚期黑色素瘤的标准治疗（现常联合MEK抑制剂），结果的外推性受限。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb59675917ad6fe0c85254d3393fc36f8992b36ec4993b742",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8ae27de5830eca759fc628f370afcd2b8009f27d54921f2e327d6430a944f905",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::ec6cf0223e6e7a02047edcc2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ec6cf0223e6e7a02047edcc2",
      "source_handle": "P0012",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "全队列（n=168），多变量调整后",
        "finding": "抗生素使用与缩短的PFS [HR 1.71, 95% CI 1.15-2.54, P=0.008] 和 OS [HR 2.24, 95% CI 1.47-3.39, P<0.0001] 独立相关。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb59675917ad6fe0c85254d3393fc36f8992b36ec4993b742",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d972fbcfc4879d72d519f4da9d43ef3a2b991a27dc610249733d249ec0cca844",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::92b8554a4f885a0a07562584": {
      "atom_id": "atom::92b8554a4f885a0a07562584",
      "source_handle": "P0012",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "体能状态较差亚组（ECOG PS ≥2）",
        "finding": "抗生素使用对OS的负面影响尤为显著，HR高达3.82 (95% CI 1.18-12.36, P=0.025)。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
