    },
    "atom::d9a739d182bc58a1b3426790": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d9a739d182bc58a1b3426790",
      "source_handle": "P0012",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "抗生素的使用是否会影响接受酪氨酸激酶抑制剂（TKI）治疗的晚期黑色素瘤和NSCLC患者的生存结局？其影响方向及强度如何？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb59675917ad6fe0c85254d3393fc36f8992b36ec4993b742",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::eff3a20747d7e76b6810bdf8f239eb12d5604341f7b7b3e843c2461bc04aa115",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::ec4c4cafe0181188fe78f47f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ec4c4cafe0181188fe78f47f",
      "source_handle": "P0012",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "回顾性队列研究，对象为2015年1月至2017年4月在英国The Christie NHS Foundation Trust接受一线酪氨酸激酶抑制剂（TKI）治疗的晚期黑色素瘤和非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb59675917ad6fe0c85254d3393fc36f8992b36ec4993b742",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1a4083d8b4b2d07a6b2be6bccd86b38f976d424fe69702177acb53c4e0fc13d0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c39e506871ab6013a37ad0b2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c39e506871ab6013a37ad0b2",
      "source_handle": "P0012",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在探讨抗生素（ABX）使用对接受靶向治疗（TKI）的晚期实体瘤患者疗效的影响。鉴于既往研究显示抗生素通过破坏肠道菌群可能降低免疫检查点抑制剂和化疗的疗效，但其在TKI治疗中的作用尚不明确，作者利用回顾性临床数据，比较了在使用TKI前后特定时间窗内使用抗生素与未使用抗生素患者的无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）。研究纳入了168名可评估患者，通过多变量分析调整混杂因素后，发现抗生素使用与较短的PFS和OS独立相关，且这种负面影响在体能状态较差的患者中更为显著。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb59675917ad6fe0c85254d3393fc36f8992b36ec4993b742",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8c695bab6d1ca983b72d6f5542f1dc7389b3b45e62a6caeb6dfe14ade50f24e5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::f16a9ebdf0d9feefd21414f5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f16a9ebdf0d9feefd21414f5",
      "source_handle": "P0012",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了抗生素干扰抗肿瘤治疗疗效的一个具体反面案例：在靶向治疗（TKI）而非免疫治疗背景下，抗生素同样与生存获益减少相关。这有助于综述论证“抗生素对多种抗癌疗法具有普遍负面影响的假设”，并提示肠道菌群失调可能不仅限于调节免疫反应，也可能通过其他机制（如炎症、代谢或药代动力学）影响靶向药物疗效。同时，它指出了现有研究中关于因果机制（感染 vs. 菌群）的不确定性。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb59675917ad6fe0c85254d3393fc36f8992b36ec4993b742",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::160a7cd7dbe6a403e8ca12b20bb85cd6f490e6e30b69f06b8af8a8b5111781e0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::aeee672c4cf1dba74b44a631": {
      "atom_id": "atom::aeee672c4cf1dba74b44a631",
      "source_handle": "P0012",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "该研究针对的是TKI，不能直接外推至所有类型的免疫治疗或新型靶向药物；且为观察性关联，非机制性解释。",
        "contribution": "证实了在非免疫治疗（TKI）情境下，抗生素使用依然与较差的临床结局（PFS/OS）相关，支持了抗生素广泛抑制抗癌疗效的观点。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb59675917ad6fe0c85254d3393fc36f8992b36ec4993b742",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::18a93db091a6ae4a878d799e8ce898508abfca43e3448447203e04d8abfa1c67",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::95cdba8dc109cfc35cae63d9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::95cdba8dc109cfc35cae63d9",
      "source_handle": "P0012",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于综述中讨论抗生素对不同类别抗癌药物（不仅是ICI，还包括TKI和化疗）的普遍负面影响，反驳“抗生素仅影响免疫治疗”的片面观点。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb59675917ad6fe0c85254d3393fc36f8992b36ec4993b742",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::461d40bc6417e923e97ce4816e6a4f40f0ecc9c35420c7a255b24362311c700a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d51f96398e0f18e8e77b25aa": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d51f96398e0f18e8e77b25aa",
      "source_handle": "P0012",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "作者明确指出未进行粪便微生物分析，因此这些机制仅为基于文献的推测和药理学合理性假设，并非本研究的实证发现。感染本身的免疫抑制效应未被排除。",
        "contribution": "提出了抗生素影响TKI疗效的可能机制假说，包括肠道菌群多样性丧失、全身炎症反应改变以及潜在的药代动力学相互作用（如CYP3A4酶诱导/抑制）。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb59675917ad6fe0c85254d3393fc36f8992b36ec4993b742",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::18a93db091a6ae4a878d799e8ce898508abfca43e3448447203e04d8abfa1c67",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
