    "atom::6d4dcfbcfa788578fcc324d1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6d4dcfbcfa788578fcc324d1",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用叙述性综述方法。作者检索并筛选了关于肠道微生物组与ICIs疗效关系的已发表文献，分为“临床前研究”和“临床研究”两部分进行归纳。在临床前部分，按免疫治疗类型（抗CTLA-4、抗PD-L1、抗PD-1）整理动物实验中的微生物干预措施（如抗生素处理、粪便移植、单菌定植）及其对肿瘤生长和免疫表型的影响。在临床研究部分，按基线微生物多样性、抗生素使用影响、免疫介导的结肠炎以及代谢特征等主题汇总人类患者数据。最后，通过对比两类研究的异同，讨论免疫调节机制、转化挑战及未来标准化需求。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1f07454489af6b9db5b658896176f2ae26a767f84d1df9a8066f91e97b30ded9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::2048f488b617a9941ce34256": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2048f488b617a9941ce34256",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了截至2019年关于肠道微生物组与ICIs疗效关系的全面文献总结，建立了包含临床前和临床发现的系统分类框架。",
        "limits": "作为一篇叙述性综述，其结论依赖于所纳入研究的原始质量，且由于各研究间设计、人群和技术平台的差异，无法提供统一的定量效应估计。文中明确指出当前数据存在不一致性，尚未确立标准化的微生物生物标志物。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::cade4287c3754b9071adc3078b71c0d17691ed7474efb2a43eb1289bf6b4423f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3c3b6661d01e420b1c6293d1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3c3b6661d01e420b1c6293d1",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "临床前模型（小鼠）",
        "finding": "共生肠道菌群对于ICIs的抗肿瘤活性至关重要。抗生素清除或无菌环境会削弱疗效；特定细菌（如Bacteroides spp.、Akkermansia muciniphila、Bifidobacterium spp.）的补充可恢复或增强对PD-1/PD-L1/CTLA-4阻断的反应，涉及增加CD8+ T细胞浸润、促进树突状细胞成熟及诱导Th1型免疫反应。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::71f7045e075885a9a434cda3bbafabf9fdc91827c9f58053c604d90a8986dd57",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::dbc0101da3ccadc1272bcb82": {
      "atom_id": "atom::dbc0101da3ccadc1272bcb82",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "临床研究（黑色素瘤、NSCLC、RCC等）",
        "finding": "响应者通常表现出更高的肠道微生物α多样性，且富集特定菌属（如Faecalibacterium、Clostridiales目、Ruminococcaceae科、Akkermansia muciniphila）。相反，非响应者中Bacteroidales目、Escherichia coli等丰度较高。抗生素使用在某些研究中与较差的PFS/OS相关，但在其他研究中无显著影响，显示结果不一致。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::71f7045e075885a9a434cda3bbafabf9fdc91827c9f58053c604d90a8986dd57",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::8c928549ce5370fc33a0db5b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8c928549ce5370fc33a0db5b",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "机制探讨",
        "finding": "微生物可能通过抗原模拟、提供共刺激信号或直接代谢产物影响免疫系统。具体机制包括增强DCs的抗原呈递能力、促进记忆T细胞从淋巴结向肿瘤微环境（TME）迁移、减少调节性T细胞（Tregs）和髓系衍生抑制细胞（MDSCs）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::71f7045e075885a9a434cda3bbafabf9fdc91827c9f58053c604d90a8986dd57",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::92d8a6983e5f875ef67f29cb": {
      "atom_id": "atom::92d8a6983e5f875ef67f29cb",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "review",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::57154cbc0fcb696e442aa3a5cbbf54aaca458240a11380b633c28e10bea1e7c3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::df3118577f22ec33a98f4663": {
      "atom_id": "atom::df3118577f22ec33a98f4663",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管肠道微生物组被认为可能影响免疫检查点抑制剂的疗效，但目前的临床前和临床研究结果存在不一致性，且其作为预测性生物标志物的临床效用尚不明确。本研究旨在解决如何整合现有证据以理解微生物组的作用，并识别阻碍其转化为可靠生物标志物的关键障碍。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::16450b1d03cfb946c90a651a53b7467dcb6b1b03ad9f2d13197c81df9bb90285",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a2a62233a277d1362a8ccff8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a2a62233a277d1362a8ccff8",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "该综述聚焦于肠道微生物组（gut microbiome）与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs，包括PD-1、PD-L1和CTLA-4抑制剂）抗肿瘤疗效之间的关系。研究范围涵盖了临床前（小鼠模型）和临床研究两个层面，旨在梳理现有的证据基础、潜在的免疫调节机制以及当前研究中存在的不一致性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ef64892670a184b862870cb89cd83b676f056cd6c20326dfd2eff8e6bb248210",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::63945f6ef57088b1a632725a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::63945f6ef57088b1a632725a",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇系统性综述，旨在评估肠道微生物组作为预测免疫检查点抑制剂疗效生物标志物的潜力。作者综合了已发表的临床前研究和临床研究结果，详细列举了与ICIs疗效正相关或负相关的特定细菌物种及分类群。文章不仅总结了微生物组影响抗肿瘤免疫反应的潜在机制（如树突状细胞成熟、T细胞浸润等），还深入探讨了临床前与临床研究之间发现的不一致性问题，分析了导致这些差异的可能原因（如宿主-微生物生态系统的复杂性、采样与分析方法的标准化不足等），并提出了未来建立可靠生物标志物所需的研究方向和方法学改进建议。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::70393ae92c5a5f4572b2e025b42903fa79a80f2aac8b283e1bf2c5e734ab6a96",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::2c7a048c4a0b6dc1bd6bdbe2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2c7a048c4a0b6dc1bd6bdbe2",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为构建“肠道微生物组如何调节实体瘤中ICIs疗效”的综述提供了核心的背景框架和机制假设库。它系统地列出了被报道与疗效相关或无关的具体微生物分类群（Facet F1的关键素材），并详细阐述了作者提出的免疫调节机制路径（Facet F2的核心解释）。此外，它对临床前与临床数据不一致性的分析，为讨论研究异质性和方法学局限提供了重要的论述素材。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9730df683c2285dfae3c0e860797bce69f96fef96cc708fd0b8390c7ed67d4de",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::e3d16a2075982ff7167de376": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e3d16a2075982ff7167de376",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这些关联主要基于观察性研究和小型队列，因果关系未完全确立。不同研究间的定义标准（如OTU聚类算法）不同，直接比较丰度数值需谨慎。",
        "contribution": "提供了具体的微生物-疗效关联列表：正面关联包括Akkermansia muciniphila, Bifidobacterium spp., Faecalibacterium genus, Ruminococcaceae family, Clostridiales order等；负面关联包括Bacteroidales order (含Bacteroides spp.), Escherichia coli, Roseburia intestinalis等。同时指出了不同研究中结果的矛盾之处（如Bacteroidetes在某些研究中与响应相关，在其他中与不响应相关）。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2a10b41205978b7689398ced815aa0818402113ff449893a267ed06580efe034",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::eac248fe713a4d4d9c50d65e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::eac248fe713a4d4d9c50d65e",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“哪些微生物与ICIs疗效相关”的问题。可作为证据来源，展示当前领域内存在的共识菌株和争议菌株。可用于说明不同肿瘤类型（黑色素瘤 vs NSCLC/RCC）或不同ICI药物之间的差异。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7e69c7cd623676aa69bf77def2fb1a5a60af8a068f9589c95b6a7de279d89e8e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d3542d1a49feb8f802f06372": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d3542d1a49feb8f802f06372",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "许多机制细节来自小鼠模型（如B. fragilis诱导Th1反应），在人体中的直接验证有限。综述指出具体细菌种类与特定免疫通路的精确对应关系仍不完全清楚，需警惕将动物模型机制直接外推至人类。",
        "contribution": "阐述了微生物影响ICIs疗效的潜在生物学机制：1) 增强树突状细胞（DCs）成熟和抗原呈递；2) 促进CD4+和CD8+ T细胞（特别是记忆T细胞和效应T细胞）向肿瘤微环境的募集和活化；3) 调节Treg和MDSC的比例；4) 通过代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸等，虽提及但未详述具体分子）影响免疫状态。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2a10b41205978b7689398ced815aa0818402113ff449893a267ed06580efe034",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6bb99b9bf1266608d5dc8b76": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6bb99b9bf1266608d5dc8b76",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于解释“微生物如何调节疗效”的机制部分。提供具体的细胞和分子通路描述，支持关于免疫系统激活的论点。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7e69c7cd623676aa69bf77def2fb1a5a60af8a068f9589c95b6a7de279d89e8e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::17da5e4bc3b5aa34f96ea596": {
      "atom_id": "atom::17da5e4bc3b5aa34f96ea596",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "综述讨论了采样方法（粪便vs盲肠内容物）、测序技术（16S rRNA vs 宏基因组鸟枪法）、数据分析流程以及混杂因素（饮食、抗生素、地理位置）对结果一致性的影响。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
