    "atom::30a8980c13b3672ea88d08e4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::30a8980c13b3672ea88d08e4",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "综述中引用的临床前和临床研究之间存在明显的异质性，不能简单地将所有阳性结果合并为一个统一的“有益微生物”列表，必须保留其情境依赖性（如肿瘤类型、ICI药物类型）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::787edb8c828b34cf233abc03a89e011b286508975d100348ca9c608e8c1c2fe8",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::bb2e061a8745a6ec51f716ef": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bb2e061a8745a6ec51f716ef",
      "source_handle": "P0171",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "对于“抗生素使用”的影响，综述本身也指出了相互矛盾的证据，因此在引用时应明确区分不同研究的结论，避免一概而论。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f3da1997c949e2adcf683eda9da3929138dc39dff",
          "field_path": [
