      "source_handle": "P0375",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "本文主要聚焦于饮食干预，其对ICIs疗效的讨论主要集中在癌症免疫治疗领域，且多为观察性关联，需谨慎推断因果关系。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c03807a60bd112424d82eb3a37a40be8d0b71eb096",
          "field_path": [
