    "atom::91ee4199ed9203bb31c2a3e6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::91ee4199ed9203bb31c2a3e6",
      "source_handle": "P0229",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该综述是2020年发表的，后续可能有新的重大发现，使用时需注意时效性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6ffe1fed9e151d6b7556b5eb1b479211931ba41f6c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2bd0438f43f12e1af0eddee669e1bb6b3d2c8562963f772d5cf5619aa0fc813e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::054563d2038db64bf6dbf5f8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::054563d2038db64bf6dbf5f8",
      "source_handle": "P0229",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中提到的许多机制主要基于小鼠模型（germ-free mice, antibiotic-treated mice），在向人类推广时需格外谨慎，因为小鼠和人类的肠道微生物组成及生理存在显著差异。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6ffe1fed9e151d6b7556b5eb1b479211931ba41f6c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2bd0438f43f12e1af0eddee669e1bb6b3d2c8562963f772d5cf5619aa0fc813e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::189ee075d443a0a8a4076fde": {
      "atom_id": "atom::189ee075d443a0a8a4076fde",
      "source_handle": "P0229",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "对于益生菌和FMT的效果，文中明确指出临床证据有限且存在冲突，不应将其视为已确立的标准疗法。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6ffe1fed9e151d6b7556b5eb1b479211931ba41f6c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2bd0438f43f12e1af0eddee669e1bb6b3d2c8562963f772d5cf5619aa0fc813e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::788bf004ee45cd5fa0bb13bd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::788bf004ee45cd5fa0bb13bd",
      "source_handle": "P0229",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "不同癌症类型（如CRC vs Melanoma vs NSCLC）中微生物的作用可能截然不同，需区分对待，避免过度泛化。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
