    "atom::eae7452630896bd2e34e5212": {
      "atom_id": "atom::eae7452630896bd2e34e5212",
      "source_handle": "P0059",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "1. 肠道微生物群的改变是癌症发病的因果驱动因素还是继发性后果？2. 微生物群失调与癌症风险之间是否存在双向因果关系？3. 血浆代谢物在微生物-癌症相互作用中发挥多大程度的介导作用？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e2aa2ddeabc0985c91b1f33123b023691a7c6a07c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e04ae90b8820342ea950a83e2e8ad7591131d8caa0696c74cc560a4c2938e968",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::26f95f0b97bc5ed89346f58e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::26f95f0b97bc5ed89346f58e",
      "source_handle": "P0059",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "研究欧洲人群（GWAS数据）中肠道微生物群（473种菌属/种、205条代谢通路）、血浆代谢物（1091种代谢物及309种比值）与8种泛癌（乳腺癌、结直肠癌、子宫内膜癌、食管癌、卵巢癌、肺癌、前列腺癌、甲状腺癌）之间的因果关系。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e2aa2ddeabc0985c91b1f33123b023691a7c6a07c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c57a22037f36e01938a18ba590eff4401a9748c468856f13c5bf9772e959d644",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::72c3469b1383e11cd71c06c6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::72c3469b1383e11cd71c06c6",
      "source_handle": "P0059",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在解决肠道微生物群改变是癌症病因还是继发后果的争议，以及两者间的双向因果和代谢介导机制尚不明确的问题。作者利用两样本双向孟德尔随机化（MR）分析，结合多变量MR（MVMR）和中介效应分析，系统评估了肠道微生物、血浆代谢物与泛癌风险之间的潜在因果联系。研究通过筛选遗传工具变量，排除了异质性和水平多效性干扰，识别出具有稳健因果关联的微生物、代谢物和通路，并量化了代谢物在微生物-癌症轴中的中介比例。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e2aa2ddeabc0985c91b1f33123b023691a7c6a07c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ea75dae2f31036bca7f51c901d6b2abb74aaa43bf31adb61ad097a9696a77656",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8183fbd4e9d66b2855586773": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8183fbd4e9d66b2855586773",
      "source_handle": "P0059",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文通过孟德尔随机化方法，从遗传角度证实了肠道微生物及其代谢产物对多种实体瘤（如食管癌、乳腺癌等）的潜在因果影响，并量化了代谢物的中介作用。对于综述而言，其核心价值在于提供了“微生物-代谢物-肿瘤”这一具体机制路径的因果证据，特别是针对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）疗效相关的炎症和代谢微环境调控，提供了基础生物学层面的支持素材。然而，该研究未直接涉及ICIs疗效的临床终点数据，主要提供的是易感性和病理生理机制的背景证据。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e2aa2ddeabc0985c91b1f33123b023691a7c6a07c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7b429f806c27c01dfe507003af80e0802a5ab82c38478f80dba95ee09f7f1528",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3a7b4f528c7f9b50a18a2cfd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3a7b4f528c7f9b50a18a2cfd",
      "source_handle": "P0059",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这些中介效应是基于遗传关联推断的，并非直接的实验验证机制。中介比例通常较小，且多数关联仅在名义显著水平，需谨慎解读其临床解释力。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物通过调节特定血浆代谢物（如棕榈油酸、丙酰肉碱等）进而影响癌症风险的因果证据链。具体指出了9条中介通路，例如Gordonibacter通过Palmitoleate影响食管癌。这有助于解释微生物如何不直接作用于肿瘤细胞，而是通过系统性代谢重编程来介导其对宿主的影响。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e2aa2ddeabc0985c91b1f33123b023691a7c6a07c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b29af54c71572b5d1af4f78c5d5afa45a9a9c994e613becafe31b8573247c452",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d321b7a8d968c92298f6eda7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d321b7a8d968c92298f6eda7",
      "source_handle": "P0059",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于综述中阐述微生物影响肿瘤发生发展的间接机制，特别是代谢途径在微生物-宿主互作中的桥梁作用。可作为解释为何某些微生物群落特征与免疫治疗响应相关的背景理论依据。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e2aa2ddeabc0985c91b1f33123b023691a7c6a07c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ccdf2418e1bbfdedf6df079130159a0daed5aee1a159380018880fd5cbb1e3bd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::81b663c0ae20f274dc44b366": {
      "atom_id": "atom::81b663c0ae20f274dc44b366",
      "source_handle": "P0059",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "研究关注的是癌症发病风险（etiology），而非现有癌症患者接受ICI治疗后的疗效（efficacy/response）。因此，不能直接推断这些微生物对ICI疗效的影响方向或程度。",
        "contribution": "识别了与多种实体瘤（包括肺癌、乳腺癌、结直肠癌等ICI主要适应症）有因果关联的特定微生物属（如Ruminococcus D bicirculans, Gluconobacter, Holdemania等）。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e2aa2ddeabc0985c91b1f33123b023691a7c6a07c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b29af54c71572b5d1af4f78c5d5afa45a9a9c994e613becafe31b8573247c452",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::b60bea4cebd902ad17b310a0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b60bea4cebd902ad17b310a0",
      "source_handle": "P0059",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "作为背景材料，说明哪些微生物与实体瘤发生密切相关。若综述需要讨论“基线微生物组状态如何预示肿瘤易感性从而间接影响治疗窗口”，此数据可用。也可作为对比基准，区分“致癌微生物”与可能“增强免疫治疗”的微生物。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e2aa2ddeabc0985c91b1f33123b023691a7c6a07c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ccdf2418e1bbfdedf6df079130159a0daed5aee1a159380018880fd5cbb1e3bd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::de7a4522c66f7ab6f27feff7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::de7a4522c66f7ab6f27feff7",
      "source_handle": "P0059",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "研究发现8条血浆代谢通路参与多种癌症发展，如氨基酸代谢、嘌呤降解等。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e2aa2ddeabc0985c91b1f33123b023691a7c6a07c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e832eb2e0ae84bd14101bb9cb53c23a119285f816deb3fd86a5f2195a4393a3e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::fb82b018d598a273b81167d6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fb82b018d598a273b81167d6",
      "source_handle": "P0059",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses",
        "connection_to_review"
      ],
      "value": "这些代谢通路可能与免疫细胞的能量代谢和功能状态有关，从而构成ICI疗效调节的潜在生物学基础。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e2aa2ddeabc0985c91b1f33123b023691a7c6a07c",
          "field_path": [
